  "body": "Set across thoughtfully designed levels, these freehold terraces offer flexible layouts ideal for families, professionals, co-owners, or investors. \r\n\r\nChoose between two layout options crafted to suit your needs. \r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Two Distinct Layout Styles:  \r\n- 2-Storey Style: 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms (includes 1 master ensuite)\r\n- 3-Storey Style: 3 bedrooms, 3 ensuites, plus a separate guest WC\r\n\r\n• Brand-new freehold terraced homes\r\n\r\n• Modern kitchens with SMEG appliances\r\n\r\n• Spacious open-plan living and dining spaces\r\n\r\n• Ground-floor bedroom option with private deck\r\n\r\n• Single internal-access garage\r\n\r\n• Close to Stanmore Bay Village and beaches\r\n\r\n• In zone for Whangaparaoa College and Stanmore Bay School\r\n\r\n• Society fee: $698.94\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for a stylish first home, a comfortable family base, or an investment with strong flexibility, these properties deliver a combination of privacy, practicality, and modern living. With versatile layout choices and a convenient location, they offer plenty of appeal for buyers seeking something exceptional in Stanmore Bay.\r\n\r\nLocated close to Stanmore Bay Village, beautiful local beaches, and the upcoming Penlink, this is a smart opportunity in a sought-after coastal setting.",
